blic Python control values. Golden must return exactly the frozen number and order of complete ciphertext expressions; a Plain helper result is not an additional encrypted output.","This native contract admits bounded for ... in range(...) expansion. It does not admit if, conditional expressions, comparisons, Boolean operators, while, break, continue, comprehensions or for-else, including conditions written entirely with public literals. Each range has at most 128 iterations; module expansion, AST and work budgets also apply. Loop targets are public induction variables; nested loops use distinct targets, and those targets cannot be assigned in the body. No return inside a loop. Callable native c/p helpers do not add public control flow."]},"typed_request_bindings":{"constant_bindings":[{"immutable":true,"name":"mask0","shape":[4],"type":"prebound_public_plain"},{"immutable":true,"name":"mask1","shape":[4],"type":"prebound_public_plain"},{"immutable":true,"name":"p0","shape":[],"type":"prebound_public_plain"},{"immutable":true,"name":"p1","shape":[],"type":"prebound_public_plain"},{"immutable":true,"name":"p2","shape":[],"type":"prebound_public_plain"},{"immutable":true,"name":"p3","shape":[],"type":"prebound_public_plain"},{"immutable":true,"name":"p4","shape":[],"type":"prebound_public_plain"},{"immutable":true,"name":"p5","shape":[],"type":"prebound_public_plain"},{"immutable":true,"name":"p6","shape":[],"type":"prebound_public_plain"},{"immutable":true,"name":"tail2","shape":[4],"type":"prebound_public_plain"}],"directed_acceptance":[],"output_ciphertexts":1,"rotation_steps":[1,2],"scope":"Public ABI and registered types only. No model implementation, private test values or deterministic DSL answer. Existing validator, contribution probes, tracing and numerical gates remain authoritative.","slot_period":4,"type_rules":{"broadcast":"Native object-array arithmetic uses the admitted array-left +, -, * forms and whole-Expr cell broadcasting. Scalar Expr arithmetic re